{"text": " \u542c\u4e0b\u9762\u4e00\u6bb5\u6750\u6599,\u56de\u7b54\u4ee5\u4e0b\u51e0\u4e2a\u5c0f\u9898\u3002 Good morning everyone. The City Flower Festival is nearly upon us. The last six months have been particularly busy trying to finalise details for the show. This year promises to be particularly special. It is the centenary celebration of the founding of our city cathedral. Because of this, we have put more money than ever before into this event to create bigger and better shows. This year's subject reflects the cultural diversity of our city and is entitled Flowers of the World. As has been the custom for the last five festivals, when the festival ends, all flowers will be sold to raise money for a local children's charity. Entry to the Flower Festival will cost between $16 and $28 depending on the day and time. This year, to encourage a wider range of visitors to the festival, there will be discounts on family tickets and children under 14 will go free. I'm sure that this festival will be a great success and I look forward to welcoming visitors to the event from May 26th to 29th. Good morning everyone. The City Flower Festival is nearly upon us. The last six months have been particularly busy trying to finalise details for the show. This year promises to be particularly special. It is the centenary celebration of the founding of our city cathedral. Because of this, we have put more money than ever before into this event to create bigger and better shows. This year's subject reflects the cultural diversity of our city and is entitled Flowers of the World. As has been the custom for the last five festivals, when the festival ends, all flowers will be sold to raise money for a local children's charity. Entry to the Flower Festival will cost between $16 and $28 depending on the day and time. This year, to encourage a wider range of visitors to the festival, there will be discounts on family tickets and children under 14 will go free. I'm sure that this festival 